XU LY BO TEST MOI

[BONUS] --- GIAI THICH CHI TIET THUAT TOAN NHAN ---
* Thong so: Ma vong C(n=12, k=8)
* Da thuc kiem tra h(x) = 1 + x^4
* Da thuc ban tin m(x)  = 1 + x^2 + x^4 + x^6
--------------------------------------------------
BUOC 1: Xay dung phan ban tin cho tu ma he thong.
- Trong ma he thong, ban tin m(x) duoc giu nguyen va dat vao k vi tri bac cao nhat.
- Tuong duong viec tinh x^(n-k) * m(x).
  -> Gan c_4 = m_0 = 1
  -> Gan c_5 = m_1 = 0
  -> Gan c_6 = m_2 = 1
  -> Gan c_7 = m_3 = 0
  -> Gan c_8 = m_4 = 1
  -> Gan c_9 = m_5 = 0
  -> Gan c_10 = m_6 = 1
  -> Gan c_11 = m_7 = 0

BUOC 2: Tinh (n-k) bit kiem tra (parity bits).
- Su dung he thuc truy hoi tu da thuc kiem tra h(x):
  c_p = SUM(h_j * c_{p + k - j}) voi j chay tu 0 den k-1
- Tinh tuong tu viec dich bit qua thanh ghi lfsr:
  => Tinh c_3:
     c_3 = c_11(=0) + c_7(=0) = 0
  => Tinh c_2:
     c_2 = c_10(=1) + c_6(=1) = 0
  => Tinh c_1:
     c_1 = c_9(=0) + c_5(=0) = 0
  => Tinh c_0:
     c_0 = c_8(=1) + c_4(=1) = 0
--------------------------------------------------
[KET QUA] Da thuc tu ma hoan chinh c(x) = x^4 + x^6 + x^8 + x^10

=> Vector tu ma: 0 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 1 0 1 0